{"seq":4,"slug":"streaming-ingestion","title":"流式数据接入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-data-engineering/data-collection-cleaning/streaming-ingestion","wordCount":818,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"流式数据接入\">流式数据接入</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>流式数据接入（Streaming Data Ingestion）是实时或近实时地将持续产生的数据流接入到数据系统中的技术。与批量数据采集不同，流式接入处理的是无界的、持续到达的数据——用户行为日志、传感器数据、交易记录和社交媒体动态等。在 AI 系统中，流式接入使模型能够基于最新数据进行推理和持续学习。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[数据源] --&gt; B[消息队列]&#10;    B --&gt; C[流处理引擎]&#10;    C --&gt; D[实时特征计算]&#10;    C --&gt; E[数据湖存储]&#10;    C --&gt; F[实时告警]&#10;    D --&gt; G[在线推理服务]&#10;    E --&gt; H[离线训练]&#10;    B --&gt; I[数据回放]\">graph LR\n    A[数据源] --&gt; B[消息队列]\n    B --&gt; C[流处理引擎]\n    C --&gt; D[实时特征计算]\n    C --&gt; E[数据湖存储]\n    C --&gt; F[实时告警]\n    D --&gt; G[在线推理服务]\n    E --&gt; H[离线训练]\n    B --&gt; I[数据回放]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>批量处理</th>\n<th>微批处理</th>\n<th>流式处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>小时级</td>\n<td>秒-分钟级</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>吞吐量</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义保证</td>\n<td>Exactly-Once 容易</td>\n<td>Exactly-Once 可行</td>\n<td>At-Least-Once 常见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态管理</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型工具</td>\n<td>Spark Batch</td>\n<td>Spark Streaming</td>\n<td>Kafka Streams/Flink</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>历史分析</td>\n<td>准实时分析</td>\n<td>实时特征/告警</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>流式数据接入的核心挑战是在<strong>低延迟</strong>、<strong>高吞吐</strong>和<strong>数据一致性</strong>之间取得平衡，同时处理乱序到达、数据积压和系统故障等现实问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"消息队列架构\">消息队列架构</h2><p>消息队列是流式数据接入的基础设施，在数据生产者和消费者之间提供可靠的缓冲和解耦。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface StreamConfig {&#10;  topic: string;&#10;  partitions: number;&#10;  replicationFactor: number;&#10;  retentionMs: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ProducerConfig {&#10;  batchSize: number;&#10;  lingerMs: number;&#10;  acks: &#39;none&#39; | &#39;leader&#39; | &#39;all&#39;;&#10;  compression: &#39;none&#39; | &#39;gzip&#39; | &#39;snappy&#39; | &#39;lz4&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ConsumerConfig {&#10;  groupId: string;&#10;  autoOffsetReset: &#39;earliest&#39; | &#39;latest&#39;;&#10;  maxPollRecords: number;&#10;  commitStrategy: &#39;auto&#39; | &#39;manual&#39;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StreamConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  topic</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  partitions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  replicationFactor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  retentionMs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProducerConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  batchSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  lingerMs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  acks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'none'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'leader'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'all'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  compression</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'none'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'gzip'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'snappy'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'lz4'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ConsumerConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  groupId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  autoOffsetReset</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'earliest'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'latest'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxPollRecords</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  commitStrategy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'auto'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'manual'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Producer 1] --&gt; B[Topic Partition 0]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Topic Partition 1]&#10;    D[Producer 2] --&gt; B&#10;    D --&gt; C&#10;    D --&gt; E[Topic Partition 2]&#10;    B --&gt; F[Consumer Group A]&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    B --&gt; G[Consumer Group B]&#10;    C --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G\">graph TD\n    A[Producer 1] --&gt; B[Topic Partition 0]\n    A --&gt; C[Topic Partition 1]\n    D[Producer 2] --&gt; B\n    D --&gt; C\n    D --&gt; E[Topic Partition 2]\n    B --&gt; F[Consumer Group A]\n    C --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    B --&gt; G[Consumer Group B]\n    C --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G</pre><p>消息队列选型对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Kafka</th>\n<th>Pulsar</th>\n<th>RabbitMQ</th>\n<th>Redis Streams</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>吞吐量</td>\n<td>百万/秒</td>\n<td>百万/秒</td>\n<td>万/秒</td>\n<td>十万/秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>毫秒</td>\n<td>毫秒</td>\n<td>微秒</td>\n<td>微秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持久化</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息回溯</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运维复杂度</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"流处理模式\">流处理模式</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface StreamEvent&lt;T&gt; {&#10;  key: string;&#10;  value: T;&#10;  timestamp: number;&#10;  partition: number;&#10;  offset: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface WindowConfig {&#10;  type: &#39;tumbling&#39; | &#39;sliding&#39; | &#39;session&#39;;&#10;  sizeMs: number;&#10;  slideMs?: number;&#10;  gapMs?: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const processWindow = &lt;T, R&gt;(&#10;  events: StreamEvent&lt;T&gt;[],&#10;  windowConfig: WindowConfig,&#10;  aggregator: (windowEvents: StreamEvent&lt;T&gt;[]) =&gt; R,&#10;): R[] =&gt; {&#10;  const results: R[] = [];&#10;&#10;  if (windowConfig.type === &#39;tumbling&#39;) {&#10;    const windows = new Map&lt;number, StreamEvent&lt;T&gt;[]&gt;();&#10;    for (const event of events) {&#10;      const windowKey = Math.floor(event.timestamp / windowConfig.sizeMs);&#10;      const existing = windows.get(windowKey) ?? [];&#10;      existing.push(event);&#10;      windows.set(windowKey, existing);&#10;    }&#10;    for (const windowEvents of windows.values()) {&#10;      results.push(aggregator(windowEvents));&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return results;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StreamEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  partition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"li